+# Plan: JSON Patch
+- Add `applyPatch` to `src/index.ts`, reusing the internal pointer `parse`.
+- Deep-clone the document into a working copy; apply each operation to it; clone every inserted value. Any throw aborts, so the caller never sees partial state.
+- Own helpers: `clone` (defineProperty so `__proto__` stays data), `deepEqual` for `test`.
+- Tests in `test/patch.test.ts`, RFC appendix A plus edge cases. No new dependencies.
